msgid "Google Cloud console: APIs & Services, Credentials, create an OAuth client ID (web application) and add this as an authorized redirect URI. Set up the OAuth consent screen first (scopes: email, profile, openid)."
msgstr "Google Cloud console: APIs & Services, Credentials, ಒಂದು OAuth client ID (web application) ರಚಿಸಿ ಮತ್ತು ಇದನ್ನು authorized redirect URI ಆಗಿ ಸೇರಿಸಿ. ಮೊದಲು OAuth consent screen ಹೊಂದಿಸಿ (scopes: email, profile, openid)."

