msgid "What is Give Gold?"
msgstr "'ಚಿನ್ನ ಕೊಡಿ' ಎಂದರೇನು?"

#: r2/templates/gilding.html:64
msgid "Gold you buy to give away later: each month of it gives someone one month of tippr gold. Kept as a balance on your account, it lets you give gold without entering payment information each time."
